      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not about \"perspective\" though. you dont see how it works. when a tool is broken or outdated, you dont try to find \"joy\" in it, you just discard it so it stops taking up space. i look at the world now and i just don't see a slot for me. i'm just an inefficiency in the system. everything feels so much quieter when i think about just... not having to struggle to be relevant anymore.",
